---
description: Edgeways design-system conformance for UI work
globs: src/app/**,src/components/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `docs/design-system.md` before UI changes: colour tokens, page headers, type scale floor, stat strips, pills, lists, empty states, layout, overflow.
- Nothing may paint outside the viewport or its plate. Wrap (`text-pretty break-words`, `min-w-0`); internal scroll is fine; page-level horizontal scroll is not. See design-system.md → “Overflow (go-live gate)”.
- Content empties (pages, boards, tables, modals) use `<EmptyState>` — icon well, solid plate, title, description. Not centred muted text. Not a dashed drop-zone rim.
- Design tokens and existing shadcn patterns only; no ad-hoc colours.
- Microcopy is British English, sentence case, commas rather than em dashes.
- No UI type below 11px; prefer 12px (`text-xs`) for XSmall. See `micro-typography.mdc`.
- Render times of day only via `formatClockTime` / `formatClockString` from `src/lib/time-format.ts`.
- Lay odds / lay stake fields: exchange increment helpers only. Wheel via `useNonPassiveWheel`, never React `onWheel`. See `lay-fields.mdc` and `docs/design-system.md` → “Lay fields (odds and stake)”.
